// ===== lane cai_mc (consts + state) =====
// Scratch transcription (Tier 3 lane): Molten Core CreatureAI (ScriptedAI) scripts.
// Mechanical port only; integrator wires `CreatureScriptAi` variants +
// `for_script` arms + `ai.rs` per-variant accessors + dispatcher arms.
// Exemplars mirrored: `content.rs` HerodAi/SmiteState structs, `herod_*` /
// `trainee_*` / `update_smite` bodies, `script_combat_drive`,
// `do_cast_spell_if_can`, `creature_health_percent`.
//
// Per script: {script_name, suggested CreatureScriptAi variant, state struct, hooks}.
// - boss_baron_geddon | BaronGeddon | BaronGeddonAi | reset, aggro, just_died, update
// - boss_garr | Garr | GarrAi | reset, aggro, just_died, spell_hit, update (+ garr_firesworn_just_died helper)
// - mob_firesworn | Firesworn | FireswornAi | reset, aggro, just_died, spell_hit, update
// - boss_gehennas | Gehennas | GehennasAi | reset, aggro, just_died, update
// - boss_golemagg | Golemagg | GolemaggAi | reset, aggro, enter_evade, just_died, damage_taken, update (+ golemagg_kill_adds helper)
// - mob_core_rager | CoreRager | CoreRagerAi | reset, aggro, damage_taken, update
// - boss_lucifron | Lucifron | LucifronAi | reset, aggro, just_died, update
// - boss_majordomo | Majordomo | MajordomoAi | reset, summoned_creature_just_died, just_reached_home, killed_unit, aggro, movement_inform, update, on_script_event (+ majordomo_domo_event helper)
// - boss_ragnaros | Ragnaros | RagnarosAi | reset, aggro, spell_hit_target, just_died, killed_unit, update (+ ragnaros_summon_sons_of_flame / ragnaros_update_lava_burst / ragnaros_do_lava_burst / ragnaros_check_for_melee helpers)
// - boss_shazzrah | Shazzrah | ShazzrahAi | reset, aggro, just_died, update
// - boss_sulfuron | Sulfuron | SulfuronAi | reset, aggro, just_died, update
// - mob_firewalker | Firewalker | FirewalkerAi | reset, aggro, update
// - mob_ancient_core_hound | AncientCoreHound | AncientCoreHoundAi | reset, just_died, update
// - mob_core_hound | CoreHound | CoreHoundAi | reset, aggro, damage_taken, update (+ core_hound_resurrect_self / core_hound_feign_death / core_hound_kill_self helpers)
// - mob_firelord | Firelord | FirelordAi | reset, aggro, just_summoned, update
// - mob_lava_surger | LavaSurger | LavaSurgerAi | reset, just_died, update
//
// Reused from content.rs (NOT redefined here): DONE, IN_PROGRESS,
// MC_NOT_STARTED, MC_TYPE_* (0-9), MC_DATA_GARR, MC_DATA_GOLEMAGG,
// MC_NPC_MAJORDOMO, MC_NPC_CORE_RAGER, MC_NPC_CORE_HOUND,
// MC_NPC_FIRESWORN, MC_NPC_FLAMEWAKER_ELITE, MC_NPC_FLAMEWAKER_HEALER,
// MC_DOMO_RECOVERY_FLAGS (UNIT_FLAG_PET_RENAME |
// UNIT_FLAG_IMMUNE_TO_PLAYER | UNIT_FLAG_IN_COMBAT),
// MC_UNIT_NPC_FLAG_GOSSIP, STAND_STATE_STAND,
// TEMPSUMMON_TIMED_DESPAWN_OUT_OF_COMBAT (kind 4).

