// ===== lane cai_stratholme (consts + state) =====
// Stratholme CreatureAI transcription (mechanical, VMaNGOS -> vmangos-rs).
// Sources: boss_baroness_anastari.cpp, boss_cannon_master_willey.cpp,
// boss_dathrohan_balnazzar.cpp, boss_magistrate_barthilas.cpp,
// boss_maleki_the_pallid.cpp, boss_nerubenkan.cpp,
// boss_order_of_silver_hand.cpp, boss_postmaster_malown.cpp,
// boss_ramstein_the_gorger.cpp, boss_timmy_the_cruel.cpp, stratholme.cpp.
// Shapes mirror `boss_herod` / `mob_scarlet_trainee` in content.rs:
// per-script state struct + `new`, `impl Map` hook methods named
// `<snake>_<hook>`, `script_combat_drive` head, `do_cast_spell_if_can`
// casts, `do_script_text(id, guid, None, -1)`.
// Reused from content.rs (NOT redefined): DONE, IN_PROGRESS, GO_STATE_READY,
// GO_STATE_ACTIVE, STRAT_TYPE_BARONESS/NERUB/PALLID/RAMSTEIN/CRISTAL_DIE/
// CRISTAL_ALL_DIE/SH_QUEST/SH_CATHELA/SH_GREGOR/SH_NEMAS/SH_VICAR/SH_AELMAR,
// STRAT_FAIL, STRAT_SPECIAL, STRAT_TEMPSUMMON_DEAD_DESPAWN,
// TEMPSUMMON_TIMED_DESPAWN_OUT_OF_COMBAT, STRAT_UNIT_FLAG_SPAWNING,
// STRAT_UNIT_FLAG_NOT_SELECTABLE.
// Per-script census {script_name, variant, state, hooks}:
// - boss_baroness_anastari -> BaronessAnastari, BaronessAnastariAi,
//   reset/just_died/damage_taken(N)/update.
// - boss_cannon_master_willey -> CannonMasterWilley, CannonMasterWilleyAi,
//   reset/aggro/just_died/just_summoned/enter_evade/update.
// - boss_dathrohan_balnazzar -> DathrohanBalnazzar, DathrohanBalnazzarAi,
//   reset/aggro/just_died/update.
// - boss_magistrate_barthilas -> MagistrateBarthilas, MagistrateBarthilasAi,
//   reset/move_in_line_of_sight(N)/just_died/update.
// - boss_maleki_the_pallid -> MalekiThePallid, MalekiThePallidAi,
//   reset/just_died/update.
// - boss_nerubenkan -> Nerubenkan, NerubenkanAi, reset/just_died/update.
// - boss_silver_hand_bosses -> SilverHandBosses, SilverHandBossesAi,
//   reset/just_died/update.
// - boss_postmaster_malown -> PostmasterMalown, PostmasterMalownAi,
//   reset/aggro/killed_unit/update.
// - boss_ramstein_the_gorger -> RamsteinTheGorger, RamsteinTheGorgerAi,
//   reset/aggro/just_died/update.
// - boss_timmy_the_cruel -> TimmyTheCruel, TimmyTheCruelAi,
//   reset/update/corpse_removed(N).
// - npc_crimson_guardsman -> CrimsonGuardsman, CrimsonGuardsmanAi,
//   reset/just_died/update.
// - mob_freed_soul -> FreedSoul, STATELESS, reset.
// - mob_restless_soul -> RestlessSoul, RestlessSoulAi,
//   reset/spell_hit(N)/just_summoned/just_died/update.
// - mobs_spectral_ghostly_citizen -> SpectralGhostlyCitizen,
//   SpectralGhostlyCitizenAi,
//   reset/spell_hit(N)/just_died/update/receive_emote(N).
// - mobs_cristal_zuggurat -> CristalZiggurat, CristalZigguratAi,
//   reset/just_died/update.
// - mobs_rat_pestifere -> RatPestifere, RatPestifereAi,
//   reset/receive_emote(N)/update (fork AddSC commented out).
// (N) = transcribed, needs new dispatcher (see unresolved).

