// Shared consts reused from content.rs (NOT redefined here):
// IN_PROGRESS, DONE, NAX_TYPE_* (all 15), NAX_NOT_STARTED,
// NAX_FAIL, NAX_SPECIAL, NAX_NPC_* (bosses, adds, GO-adjacent NPC
// ids), NAX_GO_* (all doors/gates/portals/teslas), GO_STATE_ACTIVE,
// GO_STATE_READY, TEMPSUMMON_TIMED_DESPAWN_OUT_OF_COMBAT (4),
// STAND_STATE_STAND/KNEEL, SHEATH_UNARMED/SHEATH_MELEE,
// RFD_TEMPSUMMON_DEAD_DESPAWN (7).
// Global mapping notes: fork `CastSpell(target, spell, true)` /
// `CF_TRIGGERED` casts are transcribed as
// `do_cast_spell_if_can` (self-aura upkeep as `apply_aura_by_id`);
// the integrator threads the triggered flag. Fork
// `HandleEvadeOutOfHome` failure arms map to
// `should_leash_evade` + `enter_evade_mode`. `DoResetThreat` has
// no helper (NEEDS-MAP-HELPER at each site). `AttackStart`
// overrides map to `<snake>_attack_start` helpers
// (NO-DISPATCHER-YET). `EnterCombat` override maps to
// `<snake>_enter_combat` (NO-DISPATCHER-YET).

