// ===== lane cai_zg_stv (consts + state) =====
// Mechanical transcription of VMaNGOS Zul'Gurub + Stranglethorn Vale CreatureAI
// scripts for the vmangos-rs migration (Tier 3). Senior reviewer integrates
// and verifies; fragments below mirror the `boss_herod` / `mob_scarlet_trainee`
// shapes in `vmangos-rs/crates/mangos-map/src/content.rs` and `ai.rs`.
//
// Per-script census { script_name, suggested variant, state struct, hooks }:
// - mob_yenniku -> Yenniku, YennikuAi, reset/update/spell_hit(NO-DISP)
// - mob_assistant_kryll -> AssistantKryll, AssistantKryllAi, reset/update
//   (AddSC registration commented out in fork; still transcribed)
// - npc_pats_hellfire_guy -> PatsHellfireGuy, PatsHellfireGuyAi, reset/update
// - npc_witch_doctor_unbagwa -> WitchDoctorUnbagwa, WitchDoctorUnbagwaAi,
//   reset(+reset_creature)/just_summoned/summoned_creature_just_died(NO-DISP)/
//   summoned_creature_despawn(NO-DISP, no hook)/update(+start_event helper)
// - boss_arlokk -> Arlokk, ArlokkAi,
//   reset/aggro/just_died/just_summoned/update/just_reached_home(NO-DISP)
// - mob_prowler -> Prowler, ProwlerAi, reset/just_died/update
// - boss_gahzranka -> Gahzranka, GahzrankaAi,
//   reset/aggro/just_died/just_respawned(NO-DISP)/movement_inform/update
// - boss_hakkar -> Hakkar, HakkarAi, reset/aggro/just_died/update
// - boss_jeklik -> Jeklik, JeklikAi,
//   reset/aggro/just_died/just_reached_home(NO-DISP)/update(+enter_evade
//   pre-base; ctor channeling cast has no hook, see unresolved)
// - mob_batrider -> Batrider, BatriderAi, reset/update/spell_hit_target(NO-DISP)
// - npc_guru_bat_rider -> GuruBatRider, GuruBatRiderAi, reset/aggro/update
// - boss_jindo -> Jindo, JindoAi,
//   reset/aggro/just_died/just_summoned/update/spell_hit_target(NO-DISP)
// - mob_shade_of_jindo -> ShadeOfJindo, ShadeOfJindoAi,
//   reset/update/damage_taken(NO-DISP)
// - mob_brain_wash -> BrainWashTotem, BrainWashTotemAi, reset/update
// - boss_mandokir -> Mandokir, MandokirAi,
//   reset/aggro/killed_unit/just_summoned/move_in_line_of_sight(NO-DISP)/
//   spell_hit_target(NO-DISP)/update
// - mob_ohgan -> Ohgan, OhganAi, reset/just_died/killed_unit/update
// - mob_chained_spirit -> ChainedSpirit, ChainedSpiritAi,
//   reset/update/movement_inform/spell_hit_target(NO-DISP)
//   (GetData(0) has no hook; mandokir reads the state directly)
// - mob_vilebranche -> Vilebranche, STATELESS, update
//   (AddSC registration commented out in fork; JustDied empty)
// - boss_marli -> Marli, MarliAi,
//   reset/aggro/just_summoned/just_died/spell_hit_target(NO-DISP)/update
// - boss_renataki -> Renataki, RenatakiAi, reset/just_died/update
// - boss_venoxis -> Venoxis, VenoxisAi,
//   reset/aggro/enter_evade/just_reached_home(NO-DISP)/just_died/update
// - npc_gurubashi_axethrower -> GurubashiAxeThrower, GurubashiAxeThrowerAi,
//   reset/aggro/update (AddSC registration commented out in fork)
// - npc_gurubashi_berserker -> GurubashiBerserker, GurubashiBerserkerAi,
//   reset/aggro/update
// - npc_hakkari_doctor -> HakkariDoctor, HakkariDoctorAi,
//   reset/just_died/update
// - npc_esprit_vaudou -> EspritVaudou, STATELESS, reset/update
// - npc_fils_hakkar -> FilsHakkar, FilsHakkarAi, reset/just_died/update
//   (AddSC registration commented out in fork)
// - npc_jinxed_voodoo_pile -> JinxedVoodooPile, JinxedVoodooPileAi,
//   reset/update (no hostile head; charm-gated)
//
// Reused from content.rs (NOT redefined): DONE, IN_PROGRESS, GO_STATE_ACTIVE,
// GO_STATE_READY, ZG_TYPE_*/ZG_DATA_* (zulgurub.h set), ZG_SPELL_THEKAL_...,
// ZG_NPC_* entries. SPELL_HAKKAR_POWER_DOWN (24693) has no shared const in
// content.rs, so per-script ARLOKK_/JEKLIK_/MARLI_/VENOXIS_ consts are defined
// below. ZG_NOT_STARTED/ZG_FAIL equivalents are also missing (only
// ZF_/SCH_/ULD_/etc. variants exist), so ZG_NOT_STARTED and JEKLIK_FAIL are
// defined here; the integrator may replace them with shared consts.

