// EK-zone CreatureAI transcription (mechanical, VMaNGOS -> vmangos-rs).
// Sources (fork `vmangos/src/scripts/eastern_kingdoms/`):
// - `arathi_highlands/arathi_highlands.cpp` (whole file)
// - `duskwood/duskwood.cpp` (whole file)
// - `eastern_plaguelands/eastern_plaguelands.cpp` (whole file)
// - `elwynn_forest/elwynn_forest.cpp` (whole file)
// - `hinterlands/hinterlands.cpp` (whole file)
// - `loch_modan/loch_modan.cpp` (whole file)
// - `redridge_mountains/redridge_mountains.cpp` (whole file)
// - `searing_gorge/searing_gorge.cpp` (whole file)
// - `silverpine_forest/silverpine_forest.cpp` (whole file)
// - `undercity/undercity.cpp` (whole file)
// - `wetlands/wetlands.cpp` (whole file)
// Shapes mirror `boss_herod` / `mob_scarlet_trainee` in content.rs:
// per-script state struct + `new`, `impl Map` hook methods named
// `<snake>_<hook>`, `script_combat_drive` head, `do_cast_spell_if_can`
// casts, `do_script_text(id, speaker, Option<target>, -1)`.
// Reused from content.rs (NOT redefined): `DONE`, `IN_PROGRESS`,
// `GO_STATE_ACTIVE`, `GO_STATE_READY`, `STAND_STATE_STAND`,
// `STAND_STATE_KNEEL`, `RFD_TEMPSUMMON_DEAD_DESPAWN` (kind 7),
// `BRD_TEMPSUMMON_TIMED_OR_DEAD_DESPAWN` (kind 1),
// `TEMPSUMMON_TIMED_DESPAWN_OUT_OF_COMBAT` (kind 4),
// `MC_TEMPSUMMON_MANUAL_DESPAWN` (kind 8),
// `ULD_UNIT_FLAG_IMMUNE_TO_PLAYER`, `ULD_UNIT_FLAG_IMMUNE_TO_NPC`,
// `ULD_UNIT_FLAG_NOT_SELECTABLE`.
// Per-script census {script_name, variant, state, hooks}:
// - npc_twilight_corrupter -> TwilightCorrupter, TwilightCorrupterAi,
//   reset/aggro/update.
// - watcher_blomberg -> WatcherBlomberg, WatcherBlombergAi,
//   reset/reset_creature(N)/update.
// - commander_felstrom -> CommanderFelstrom, CommanderFelstromAi,
//   reset/just_died/update.
// - npc_sirra_vonindi -> SirraVonindi, SirraVonindiAi,
//   reset/reset_creature(N)/update.
// - npc_eris_havenfire -> ErisHavenfire, ErisHavenfireAi,
//   reset/attacked_by(N)/move_in_line_of_sight(N)/just_summoned/
//   summoned_movement_inform(N)/summoned_creature_just_died/update.
// - npc_eris_havenfire_peasant -> ErisHavenfirePeasant,
//   ErisHavenfirePeasantAi, reset/killed_unit(no-op)/damage_taken(N)/
//   spell_hit(N)/move_in_line_of_sight(N no-op)/movement_inform/update.
// - npc_joseph_redpath -> JosephRedpath, JosephRedpathAi,
//   reset/movement_inform/update.
// - npc_demetria -> Demetria, DemetriaAi,
//   reset/movement_inform(N waypoint)/just_died/update.
// - npc_guard_didier -> GuardDidier, GuardDidierAi, reset/
//   just_respawned(N)/just_died/just_reached_home(N)/
//   group_member_just_died(N)/damage_taken(N)/attack_start(N).
// - npc_caravan_mule -> CaravanMule, STATELESS, reset/damage_taken(N)/
//   attack_start(N).
// - npc_henze_faulk -> HenzeFaulk, HenzeFaulkAi, reset/
//   move_in_line_of_sight(N no-op)/spell_hit(N)/update.
// - npc_obsidion -> Obsidion, ObsidionAi, reset/aggro/
//   summoned_creature_despawn(N)/just_respawned(N)/update.
// - npc_lady_sylvanas_windrunner -> Sylvanas, SylvanasAi,
//   reset/enter_combat(N)/update.
// - npc_slims_friend -> SlimsFriend, SlimsFriendAi, reset/
//   attacked_by(N)/attack_start(N)/update.
// - npc_professor_phizzlethorpe, npc_shakes_o_breen, npc_kinelory,
//   npc_watcher_selkin, npc_stitches, npc_rinji, npc_miran,
//   npc_corporal_keeshan, npc_deathstalker_erland, npc_tapoke_slim_jahn:
//   all `npc_escortAI`-derived -> ESCORT-FRAMEWORK (see unresolved).
// (N) = transcribed, needs new dispatcher (see unresolved).

