// ===== lane cai_aq_ruins (consts + state) =====
// Mechanical transcription of VMaNGOS Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj CreatureAI scripts
// (ScriptedAI classes registered via GetAI) for the vmangos-rs migration
// (Tier 3). Senior reviewer integrates and verifies; fragments mirror the
// `boss_herod` / `mob_scarlet_trainee` shapes in
// `vmangos-rs/crates/mangos-map/src/content.rs` and `ai.rs`.
//
// Per-script census { script_name, suggested variant, state struct, hooks }:
// - boss_ayamiss -> Ayamiss, AyamissAi,
//   reset/aggro/just_died/spell_hit_target/just_summoned/update
//   (boss_ayamiss.cpp 60-300)
// - mob_zara_larva -> ZaraLarva, ZaraLarvaAi, reset/update (302-364)
// - boss_buru -> Buru, BuruAi, reset/aggro(EnterCombat)/just_died/
//   attack_start/update (boss_buru.cpp 54-312)
// - mob_buru_egg -> BuruEgg, STATELESS, damage_taken/just_died/update
//   (315-353; Reset/UpdateAI empty in the fork)
// - boss_kurinnaxx -> Kurinnaxx, KurinnaxxAi,
//   reset/just_respawned/aggro/just_died/update (boss_kurinnaxx.cpp 42-163)
// - boss_moam -> Moam, MoamAi, reset/aggro/just_died/just_summoned/update
//   (boss_moam.cpp 43-204)
// - boss_ossirian -> Ossirian, OssirianAi,
//   reset/spell_hit_target/spell_hit/aggro/just_died/killed_unit/update
//   (boss_ossirian.cpp 61-279)
// - generic_random_move -> GenericRandomMove, GenericRandomMoveAi,
//   reset/update (283-329; AddSC registration commented out in the fork,
//   still transcribed)
// - npc_sandstalker -> Sandstalker, SandstalkerAi,
//   reset/aggro/just_died/just_reached_home/update (npc_sandstalker.cpp)
// - mob_anubisath_guardian -> AnubisathGuardian, AnubisathGuardianAi,
//   reset/aggro/just_died/just_summoned/summoned_creature_despawn/
//   damage_taken/update (ruins_of_ahnqiraj.cpp 54-181)
// - mob_tornado_ossirian -> OssirianTornado, STATELESS,
//   reset/aggro/update (183-207)
// - mob_flesh_hunter -> FleshHunter, FleshHunterAi,
//   reset/aggro/killed_unit/update (222-353)
// - mob_obsidian_destroyer -> ObsidianDestroyer, ObsidianDestroyerAi,
//   reset/aggro/just_died/update (362-412)
// - mob_hive_zara_soldier -> HiveZaraSoldier, HiveZaraSoldierAi,
//   reset/aggro/update (421-464)
// - mob_silicate_feeder -> SilicateFeeder, SilicateFeederAi,
//   reset/just_died/update (472-501)
// - mob_qiraji_swarmguard -> QirajiSwarmguard, QirajiSwarmguardAi,
//   reset/aggro/update (509-537)
// - mob_qiraji_gladiator -> QirajiGladiator, QirajiGladiatorAi,
//   reset/aggro/just_died/update (548-612)
// - mob_hive_zara_stinger -> HiveZaraStinger, HiveZaraStingerAi,
//   reset/update (620-667)
// - boss_tuubid -> Tuubid, TuubidAi, reset/update (678-745)
// - mob_qiraji_warrior -> QirajiWarrior, QirajiWarriorAi,
//   reset/aggro/damage_taken/update (755-852)
// - mob_swarmguard_needler -> SwarmguardNeedler, SwarmguardNeedlerAi,
//   reset/aggro/update (859-931)
// Other kinds in the assigned files (not transcribed): `ossirian_crystal`
// (GameObjectAI, boss_ossirian.cpp 331-371), `spell_aq20_drain_mana` +
// `spell_rajaxx_thundercrash` (SpellScript, ruins_of_ahnqiraj.cpp 962-999),
// `instance_ruins_of_ahnqiraj` (instance; already ported).
//
// Reused from content.rs (NOT redefined): IN_PROGRESS, DONE,
