// ===== lane cai_dire_maul_feralas (consts + state) =====
// Dire Maul + Feralas CreatureAI transcription (mechanical, VMaNGOS -> vmangos-rs).
// Sources: vmangos/src/scripts/kalimdor/feralas/dire_maul/boss_gordok_king.cpp,
// boss_immol_thar.cpp, boss_tendris_warpwood.cpp, boss_zevrim.cpp,
// dreadsteed_ritual.cpp, instance_dire_maul.cpp, dire_maul.h,
// vmangos/src/scripts/kalimdor/feralas/feralas.cpp.
// Shapes mirror `boss_herod` / `mob_scarlet_trainee` in content.rs:
// per-script state struct + `new`, ONE `impl Map` block with a private
// `<snake>_state_mut` accessor (matches on `ai.script`) and hook methods
// named `<snake>_<hook>`, `script_combat_drive` head,
// `do_cast_spell_if_can` casts, `do_script_text(id, guid, None, -1)`.
// Integrator: add `CreatureScriptAi` variants + `for_script` arms + `ai.rs`
// accessors + `creature_script_*` dispatcher arms (see unresolved NOTE-1).
//
// Reused from content.rs (NOT redefined): DONE, IN_PROGRESS, GO_STATE_ACTIVE,
// GO_STATE_READY, DM_TYPE_CRISTAL_EVENT, DM_TYPE_IMMOL_THAR,
// DM_DATA_TENDRIS_AGGRO, DM_TYPE_BOSS_ZEVRIM, DM_TYPE_GORDOK_TRIBUTE,
// DM_TYPE_GORDOK_OGRE_SUIT, DM_TYPE_CHORUSH_EQUIPMENT, DM_TYPE_ALZZIN,
// DM_SPECIAL, DM_NOT_STARTED, DM_NPC_CHORUSH, DM_NPC_KING_GORDOK,
// DM_NPC_GUARD_SLIPKIK.
//
// Per-script census {script_name, variant, state, hooks}:
// - boss_king_gordok -> KingGordok, KingGordokAi, reset/aggro/update.
// - boss_chorush -> Chorush, ChoRushAi, reset/update.
// - boss_immol_thar -> ImmolThar, ImmolTharAi,
//   reset/aggro/just_died/enter_evade/update.
// - boss_tendris_warpwood -> TendrisWarpwood, TendrisWarpwoodAi,
//   reset/aggro/attack_start/just_died/update.
// - boss_zevrim -> Zevrim, ZevrimAi, reset/just_died/update.
// - boss_lord_hel_nurath -> LordHelNurath, LordHelNurathAi, reset/update.
// - boss_xorothian_dreadsteed -> XorothianDreadsteed, XorothianDreadsteedAi,
//   reset/just_died/update.
// - npc_reste_mana -> ResteMana, ResteManaAi, reset/just_died/update.
// - npc_arcane_aberration -> ArcaneAberration, ArcaneAberrationAi,
//   reset/just_died/damage_taken/update.
// - npc_residual_montruosity -> ResidualMontruosity, ResidualMontruosityAi,
//   reset/just_died/update.
// - npc_mizzle_the_crafty -> MizzleTheCrafty, MizzleTheCraftyAi,
//   reset/just_reached_home/spell_hit_target (no UpdateAI in fork).
// - npc_knot_thimblejack -> KnotThimblejack, STATELESS,
//   reset/movement_inform.
// - npc_gordok_brute -> GordokBrute, GordokBruteAi, reset/aggro/update.
// - boss_guards -> Guards, GuardsAi, reset/just_died/spell_hit_target/update.
// - boss_kromcrush -> Kromcrush, KromcrushAi, reset/aggro/just_died/
//   just_summoned/enter_evade/movement_inform/update + go_to_fengus(N).
// - boss_prince_tortheldrin -> PrinceTortheldrin, PrinceTortheldrinAi,
//   reset/update.
// - boss_alzzin_the_wildshaper -> AlzzinTheWildshaper, AlzzinTheWildshaperAi,
//   reset/movement_inform/summoned_creature_just_died/aura_removed(N)/update.
// - npc_alzzins_minion -> AlzzinsMinion, STATELESS,
//   reset/move_in_line_of_sight.
// - boss_ferra -> Ferra, FerraAi, reset/move_in_line_of_sight/update.
// - boss_magister_kalendris -> MagisterKalendris, MagisterKalendrisAi,
//   reset/update.
// - boss_mushgog -> Mushgog, MushgogAi, reset/aggro/just_died/update.
// - boss_therazza -> TheRazza, TheRazzaAi, reset/aggro/just_died/update.
// - boss_skarrtheunbreakable -> SkarrTheUnbreakable, SkarrTheUnbreakableAi,
