// ===== lane cai_kal_zones (consts + state) =====
// Kalimdor-zone CreatureAI transcription (mechanical, VMaNGOS -> vmangos-rs).
// Sources (fork `vmangos/src/scripts/kalimdor/`):
// - `ashenvale/ashenvale.cpp` (whole file)
// - `azshara/azshara.cpp` (whole file)
// - `darkshore/darkshore.cpp` (whole file)
// - `desolace/desolace.cpp` (whole file)
// - `durotar/durotar.cpp` (whole file)
// - `dustwallow_marsh/dustwallow_marsh.cpp` (whole file)
// - `felwood/felwood.cpp` (whole file)
// - `moonglade/boss_omen.cpp` + `moonglade/boss_omen.h`
// - `moonglade/moonglade.cpp` (`boss_eranikus` only)
// - `mulgore/mulgore.cpp` (whole file)
// - `silithus/silithus.cpp` (whole file)
// - `stonetalon_mountains/stonetalon_mountains.cpp` (whole file)
// - `tanaris/tanaris.cpp` (whole file)
// - `teldrassil/teldrassil.cpp` (whole file)
// - `the_barrens/the_barrens.cpp` (whole file)
// - `thousand_needles/thousand_needles.cpp` (whole file)
// - `ungoro_crater/ungoro_crater.cpp` (whole file)
// - `winterspring/winterspring.cpp` (whole file)
// Shapes mirror `boss_herod` / `mob_scarlet_trainee` in content.rs:
// per-script state struct + `new`, `impl Map` hook methods named
// `<snake>_<hook>`, `script_combat_drive` head, `do_cast_spell_if_can`
// casts, `do_script_text(id, speaker, Option<target>, -1)`.
// Reused from content.rs (NOT redefined): `DONE`, `IN_PROGRESS`,
// `GO_STATE_ACTIVE`, `GO_STATE_READY`, `STAND_STATE_STAND`,
// `STAND_STATE_KNEEL`, `NEFARIAN_CLASS_HUNTER` (u8 3),
// `RFD_TEMPSUMMON_DEAD_DESPAWN` (kind 7),
// `TEMPSUMMON_TIMED_DESPAWN_OUT_OF_COMBAT` (kind 4),
// `MC_TEMPSUMMON_MANUAL_DESPAWN` (kind 8),
// `PHALANX_MOVE_PATHFINDING` bit (0x001) restated per script where read.
// Per script {script_name, variant, state struct, hooks}:
// - npc_enraged_foulweald -> EnragedFoulweald, EnragedFoulwealdAi,
//   reset/just_died/movement_inform/attack_start.
// - mob_maws -> Maws, MawsAi, reset/update/movement_inform/
//   damage_taken/just_died + maws_on_remove_from_world(N).
// - LazyPeons -> LazyPeon, LazyPeonAi, update/spell_hit/
//   movement_inform + lazy_peon_on_script_event(N).
// - npc_piznik -> Piznik, PiznikAi, just_respawned(N)/just_summoned/
//   just_died/update/attack_start + piznik_start_event(quest glue).
// - npc_murkdeep -> Murkdeep, MurkdeepAi, reset/just_summoned/update
//   + murkdeep_begin_event/areatrigger glue.
// - npc_magrami_spetre -> MagramiSpectre, MagramiSpectreAi, reset/
//   movement_inform/just_reached_home/update/update_corpse(N)
//   + magrami_spetre_set_magnet(GO glue).
// - npc_archmage_tervosh -> ArchmageTervosh, ArchmageTervoshAi,
//   reset/update + tervosh_reset_despawn_delay/tervosh_current_phase
//   (areatrigger glue).
// - npc_lady_jaina_proudmoore -> LadyJaina, LadyJainaAi, reset/
//   enter_combat(N)/update.
// - npc_emberstrife -> Emberstrife, EmberstrifeAi, reset/update.
// - npc_cursed_ooze -> CursedOoze, CursedOozeAi,
//   reset/spell_hit/update.
// - npc_tainted_ooze -> TaintedOoze, TaintedOozeAi,
//   reset/spell_hit/update.
// - boss_omen -> Omen, STATELESS, movement_inform/update/spell_hit/
//   just_died + omen_on_remove_from_world(N).
// - boss_eranikus -> Eranikus, EranikusAi, reset/enter_evade/
//   killed_unit/just_summoned/summoned_movement_inform/
//   movement_inform/update.
// - npc_solenor_the_slayer (script `npc_solenor`) -> Solenor, SolenorAi,
//   reset/aggro/enter_evade/just_summoned/just_died/spell_hit/update
//   + solenor_on_script_event(N)/solenor_begin_event/solenor_demon_despawn/
//   solenor_transform helpers.
// - npc_creeping_doom -> CreepingDoom, STATELESS, damage_taken.
// - npc_colossus -> Colossus, ColossusAi, reset/enter_evade/update/
//   just_died.
// - npc_Geologist_Larksbane -> GeologistLarksbane, GeologistLarksbaneAi,
//   reset/update + larksbane_quest_completed(quest glue).
// - npc_Emissary_Romankhan -> EmissaryRomankhan, EmissaryRomankhanAi,
//   reset/aggro/spell_hit_target/update.
// - npc_anachronos_the_ancient -> Anachronos, AnachronosAi, reset/
//   just_died/just_summoned/movement_inform/summoned_movement_inform/
//   update + scene helpers.
// - mob_HiveRegal_HunterKiller -> HiveRegalHunterKiller,
//   HiveRegalHunterKillerAi, reset/update.
// - npc_Krug_SkullSplit -> KrugSkullSplit, KrugSkullSplitAi, reset/
//   summoned_creature_just_died/summoned_creature_despawn/just_died/
//   update + krug_start_event/krug_reset_event/krug_complete_event helpers.
// - npc_Merok (script `npc_Merok`) -> Merok, MerokAi, reset/update.
// - npc_Shai (script `npc_Shai`) -> Shai, ShaiAi, reset/update.
// - mob_captured_felwood_ooze -> CapturedFelwoodOoze,
//   CapturedFelwoodOozeAi, reset/update/movement_inform.
// - npc_precious_the_devourer -> PreciousDevourer, PreciousDevourerAi,
//   reset/aggro/enter_evade/damage_taken/update.
// - npc_simone_seductress -> SimoneSeductress, SimoneSeductressAi, reset/
//   just_reached_home/aggro/just_died/damage_taken/spell_hit/update
//   + simone_seductress_demon_despawn helper.
// - npc_simone_the_inconspicuous -> SimoneInconspicuous,
//   SimoneInconspicuousAi, reset/update + simone_inconspicuous_begin_event/
//   simone_inconspicuous_transform helpers (gossip glue).
// - npc_artorius (scripts `npc_artorius`) -> Artorius, ArtoriusAi, reset/
//   aggro/just_died/spell_hit/update + artorius_on_script_event(N)/
//   artorius_begin_event/artorius_demon_despawn/artorius_transform helpers.
// - npc_umi_yeti -> UmiYeti, STATELESS, spell_hit (+ no-op
//   move_in_line_of_sight, see unresolved).
// - npc_polly -> Polly, PollyAi, reset/aggro.
// - npc_twiggy_flathead -> TwiggyFlathead, TwiggyFlatheadAi, reset/update
//   + twiggy_can_start_event/twiggy_set_challengers/
//   twiggy_set_challenger_ready helpers (areatrigger glue).
// - npc_mission_possible_but_not_probable -> MissionPossible, STATELESS,
//   spell_hit.
// - npc_sarilus_foulborne -> SarilusFoulborne, SarilusFoulborneAi,
//   reset/just_summoned/update.
// - npc_plucky_johnson -> PluckyJohnson, PluckyJohnsonAi, reset/
//   receive_emote(N)/update.
// - npc_grenka_bloodscreech -> GrenkaBloodscreech, GrenkaBloodscreechAi,
//   reset/just_summoned/summoned_creature_just_died/update.
// (N) = transcribed, needs new dispatcher (see unresolved).
