        // NEEDS-MAP-HELPER: `SummonGameObject(181069, x, y, z, ...)` +
        // `SetRespawnTime(AQ20_RESPAWN_FOUR_DAYS)` (cpp 93-94); no
        // gameobject-summon helper on `Map`.
