        // NEEDS-MAP-HELPER: `GetClosestCreatureWithEntry(NPC_PRECIOUS,
        // TEXTBLOB, SIMONE_MAX_RESPAWN_TIME)` for the `m_pPrecious` link
        // (cpp 764-769); re-resolved per use below.
