    // ids + step-2 says + `NPC_BIG_WILL` (twiggy); `m_uiInitTimer` (krug);
    // `m_uiNormFaction` (plucky); `m_playerGUID` (piznik); `m_guidMagnet`
    // (magrami); `m_moundGUID` (foulweald); `m_uiFoolsPlightTimer`/
    // `m_playerGUID` (inconspicuous); Twiggy `m_uiEventTimer`/
    // `m_uiChallengerCount`/`m_uiChallengerDeath_Timer`/`m_bigWillGUID`;
    // `SAY_*` for escort-only texts; `SPELL_DESTROY_KARANG_S_BANNER_1`;
    // `SPELL_ELEMENTALS`/`SPELL_FEED_PASSIVE` (sarilus gossip).
